{"version":1,"herramienta":"whisperx medium + wav2vec2 es (letras)","audio":"corpusculo-renal.m4a","duracion":53.268,"texto":"Dentro del corpúsculo renal coexisten cuatro poblaciones celulares principales, las células endoteliales que revisten los capilares glomerulares y poseen fenestraciones indiafragma. Los podocitos que forman la capa visceral de la cápsula de Bowman y extienden prolongaciones llamadas pedicelos que rodean a los capilares y construir las ranuras de filtración. Las células mesengiales intraglomerulares ubicadas en el intersticio capilar que brindan soporte mecánico. fagocitan residuos de la membrana basal, secretan citosinas y regulan la discreción glomerular gracias a su capacidad contractil y las células epiteliales parietales, un epiterio plano simple que limita la cubierta externa de la cápsula de bomba y rodea el espacio urinario.","cues":[[0.0,"X"],[0.852,"C"],[0.952,"B"],[1.053,"E"],[1.133,"C"],[1.213,"H"],[1.313,"E"],[1.413,"B"],[1.613,"A"],[1.674,"F"],[1.794,"B"],[2.014,"F"],[2.074,"E"],[2.234,"C"],[2.355,"B"],[2.415,"D"],[2.495,"H"],[2.595,"X"],[2.976,"E"],[3.136,"C"],[3.196,"B"],[3.256,"C"],[3.316,"B"],[3.416,"C"],[3.516,"B"],[3.657,"D"],[3.737,"B"],[3.817,"E"],[4.017,"H"],[4.117,"D"],[4.197,"C"],[4.258,"E"],[4.318,"C"],[4.378,"B"],[4.498,"C"],[4.558,"F"],[4.678,"D"],[4.778,"C"],[4.858,"B"],[5.159,"C"],[5.239,"A"],[5.299,"D"],[5.359,"H"],[5.419,"B"],[5.559,"X"],[6.06,"D"],[6.12,"B"],[6.221,"C"],[6.281,"F"],[6.401,"D"],[6.481,"B"],[6.721,"E"],[6.821,"C"],[7.062,"D"],[7.122,"H"],[7.182,"B"],[7.282,"C"],[7.362,"X"],[7.743,"C"],[7.863,"A"],[7.923,"C"],[8.003,"B"],[8.264,"E"],[8.324,"B"],[8.464,"D"],[8.564,"A"],[8.624,"C"],[8.704,"H"],[8.764,"D"],[8.825,"C"],[8.905,"B"],[8.985,"X"],[9.205,"B"],[9.285,"E"],[9.446,"A"],[9.506,"C"],[9.566,"B"],[9.646,"F"],[9.726,"H"],[9.806,"D"],[9.906,"B"],[10.087,"C"],[10.147,"X"],[10.707,"E"],[10.888,"B"],[10.948,"C"],[11.188,"B"],[11.248,"X"],[11.429,"C"],[11.549,"B"],[11.609,"C"],[11.669,"B"],[11.829,"D"]